           comment = "Original MATLAB SPM12 implementation; see LICENSE.note"))
Description: Tools for estimating Dynamic Causal Models (DCM) for functional
    magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI) data using variational Laplace
    inversion (Friston et al., 2003 <doi:10.1016/S1053-8119(03)00202-7>).
    The package provides Bayesian estimation of effective connectivity
    among brain regions from BOLD time series, including the bilinear
    neural state equation and the Buxton-Friston hemodynamic response
    model. The implementation is an R port of the corresponding routines
    in the MATLAB SPM12 toolbox, with optimizations for the integration
    and Gauss-Newton inner loops.
